{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/9951a35571e0df1bcbae6fce2bb2b1c9.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a fatal accident, you awaken in an unfamiliar place. A goddess has heard your heart's desires and granted you another chance at life in a new world filled with magic. Her one condition is that you create a place in the mountains where travelers and locals can find shelter and rest. Starting with nothing but her blessing and a quiet piece of land, your new journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behold as all manner of guests slowly fill the empty rooms, bringing with them unique stories and interactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/528314c69b924c9ba1d33d3d28a11c25.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slowly expand your modest establishment into something truly majestic using gold, wood, and stone. Gather resources by harvesting wood and stone yourself through short but engaging mini-games. Unlock new skills, purchase hotel upgrades, and refurnish rooms to welcome new guests. Along the way, spend time interacting with the various hotel residents. As you raise your relationship levels with each of them, you\u2019ll eventually uncover their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/814dd3c245be3434cd084eb5c121e7c5.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/4373a2b8f18dcd206db85aa6a5e908f4.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/9cdb898bf9ea7c2a80b24dbfab42d0d5.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/6f7abb53d03103115737187cf2e1d454.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/0cce25960ee56f0bc5d7b5b338599a2a.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/e73d2475d62ea9547d19dad3b7a712b3.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gold, wood, and stone each day to spend on hotel upgrades. Every action consumes energy, so plan carefully how you spend your time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Mini-Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood, mine stone, and occasionally fend off unruly guests through simple but entertaining mini-games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of skills that grant more energy, faster relationship progression, and increased resource yields.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Events in Visual Novel Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with hotel residents to unlock new story events, dialogue options, and unique interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845640?t=1774557061","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/46c9b39336fccdb6609e35a60b4a7299225e278f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774557061","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/f19a7bb0bc0cd3ad3a361443e81b19e3446fe6f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774557061","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/f19a7bb0bc0cd3ad3a361443e81b19e3446fe6f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774557061","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/9951a35571e0df1bcbae6fce2bb2b1c9.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a fatal accident, you awaken in an unfamiliar place. A goddess has heard your heart's desires and granted you another chance at life in a new world filled with magic. Her one condition is that you create a place in the mountains where travelers and locals can find shelter and rest. Starting with nothing but her blessing and a quiet piece of land, your new journey begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behold as all manner of guests slowly fill the empty rooms, bringing with them unique stories and interactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"h