tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/0cce25960ee56f0bc5d7b5b338599a2a.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/extras/e73d2475d62ea9547d19dad3b7a712b3.avif?t=1774557061\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resource Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gold, wood, and stone each day to spend on hotel upgrades. Every action consumes energy, so plan carefully how you spend your time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fun Mini-Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood, mine stone, and occasionally fend off unruly guests through simple but entertaining mini-games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a variety of skills that grant more energy, faster relationship progression, and increased resource yields.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story Events in Visual Novel Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with hotel residents to unlock new story events, dialogue options, and unique interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Witch Pantsu"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845640/65f7c9a135e2577931296b61a757ebf022e1f53b/header.jpg?t=1774557061","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"2025 Saikey Studios","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845640/1119340449/992e099ffa3ef7e6f4e64b8bbae20b727e76b183/1774555763/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774557060","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3845640/1119340449/992e099ffa3ef7e6f4e64b8bbae20b727e76b183/17